Q2. Difference between Adapter Pattern
and Factory Method Pattern

Interview Ready Answer

Adapter Pattern

• Structural Design Pattern.
• Connects incompatible interfaces.
• Solves

  "How can two incompatible
   classes communicate?"

• Does not create objects.

• Used for compatibility and
  integration.

------------------------------------------------------------

Factory Method Pattern

• Creational Design Pattern.
• Creates objects without exposing
  the concrete class.
• Solves

  "Which object should be created?"

• Creates objects.

• Used for object creation and
  loose coupling.

------------------------------------------------------------

Examples

